{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":386525,"text":"I told Liara about how I felt. Apparently she\u0027d felt it, too, but we agreed we wouldn\u0027t let it get in the way of our mission: finding Saren."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":386529,"text":"I couldn\u0027t take the chance. I had a mission to do, and an army of angry rachni would be one more problem I didn\u0027t have time to deal with."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":386554,"text":"Anderson didn\u0027t want the job, which was a sure sign he\u0027d be perfect for it. No ambition to get in the way."}
