{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387711,"text":"I told Kaidan I wasn\u0027t interested in Liara. I had my eyes on someone else, but we agreed we wouldn\u0027t let it get in the way of our mission: finding Saren."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387712,"text":"I decided discretion was the better part of valor and kept my focus on our goal: finding Saren."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387713,"text":"I told Ash I wasn\u0027t interested in Liara. I had my eyes on someone else, but we agreed we wouldn\u0027t let it get in the way of our mission: finding Saren."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387716,"text":"I couldn\u0027t do it. I wouldn\u0027t doom an entire species for past sins, and the queen was true to her word. She left and took her army of drones with her."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387718,"text":"He just couldn\u0027t be reasoned with, and I couldn\u0027t let the base be saved, even if it meant curing the krogan. Saren had to be stopped."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387719,"text":"Fortunately, Wrex is smarter than he looks. He realized this wasn\u0027t the way to help his people and that Saren was the real threat."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387723,"text":"Kaidan was a good man and a great soldier, but I had to choose."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387725,"text":"Ash was a good friend and a great soldier, but I had to choose."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387731,"text":"The Council had to be saved. They represented the hearts and minds of the galactic community. Without them, the fleets would be in disarray."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387732,"text":"The Council could be replaced. The fleets were needed here and now if we were going to defeat Sovereign."}
{"source":"ME3LE Backup/BioGame/DLC/DLC_CON_DH1/CookedPCConsole/DLC_CON_DH1_INT.tlk","id":387735,"text":"I didn\u0027t much like Udina, but sometimes you need a pit bull on your side, someone willing to be the bad guy for the sake of the greater good."}
